{"title": "Ki Restoration (Lesser)", "pageid": 15759, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Lesser)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Resource replenishing actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Greater)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Greater)\">Ki Restoration (Greater)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ki_Restoration_Lesser.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ki_Restoration_Lesser.webp/300px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser.webp, /w/images/e/e2/Ki_Restoration_Lesser.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Ki_Restoration_Lesser.webp/300px-Ki_Restoration_Lesser.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Ki_Restoration_Lesser.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Ki Restoration</b> is a class action that allows the wearer of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet\" title=\"Sentient Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet\" title=\"Sentient Amulet\">Sentient Amulet</a> to restore <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/30px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/40px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Point\" title=\"Ki Point\">Ki Points</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nUsing the spiritual energy in the amulet, you restore <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/30px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/40px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png/20px-Monk_Ki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Monk_Ki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Point\" title=\"Ki Point\">Ki Points</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MAG_Monk_Restore_Ki_Lesser</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_Monk_Restore_Ki_Lesser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MAG_Monk_Restore_Ki_Lesser\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Rare)\">Sentient Amulet (Rare)</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action is called simply 'Ki Restoration' in-game.</li>\n<li>See also <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Greater)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Greater)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp/20px-Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp/30px-Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp/40px-Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ki Restoration (Greater)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp/20px-Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Ki_Restoration_Greater_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ki_Restoration_(Greater)\" title=\"Ki Restoration (Greater)\">Ki Restoration (Greater)</a>, the more powerful version of Ki Restoration granted by the un-cursed amulet, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Very Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Sentient_Amulet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sentient_Amulet_(Very_Rare)\" title=\"Sentient Amulet (Very Rare)\">Sentient Amulet (Very Rare)</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040056\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2977/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34866/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12031/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1446404/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   69.493      1 -total\n